<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>перевозки</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
        }

        header {
            margin: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 60px;
            display: flex;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background-color: rgb(139, 211, 97);
            font-size: 25px;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: -5px;
            padding-left: 30px;
            padding-right: 30px;
        }

        footer {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: aqua;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        main {
            height: 1000px;
            display: grid;
            background-color: bisque;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .main-Headline {
            font-size: 60px;
        }

        .main-info {
            display: flex;
            border-radius: 100px;
            width: 100%;
            height: 50%;
            background-color: aqua;
        }

        .main-info p {
            position: relative;
            font-size: 40px;
            left: 100px;

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Название</h1>
        <h1>телефон</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <h1 class="main-Headline">Перевозки по Москве и области</h1>
        <div class="main-info">
            <p>узнать подробности</p>
        </div>



    </main>


    <footer>
        <P>справочная информация</P>
    </footer>


</body>

</html>
